\u00e4ltetechnik) spielerisch entdecken und erste berufstypische Aufgaben ausprobieren. Ob Technik, Gesundheit oder Handwerk \u2013 finde heraus, was dir am meisten Spa\u00df macht! :)\n\nEarly Access: Sei unter den Ersten, die jobVRiety testen!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "3902217326706597", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393450_3902217330039930_1240378813803928232_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MOT_VuDZ2LEQ7kNvwHy-yVK&_nc_oc=AdpiE6Lse_osEObn4SXRGUm2_LNZeLLYROhzs7SDmQmi11FGfaygS3o4-63Ai6elkiI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRrwORV9uHWHbvuQ7YBCKkIkrNSdTvBW_RpDKB3xmxtfg&oe=6B09B7F6"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape_1080x360.png", "id": "3076099412552471", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825091_3076099415885804_5417180118801740963_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dQnAuwW4M_4Q7kNvwH5Yzqc&_nc_oc=AdobHBk6A8zyWe_flwImKtqPvh3OYkILviPWLyNVh4jiAV9igvP-LFye-cyFcWvTD1Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS2xuhCXZeifPJLd3xVpV-wgbc-w9t6EVa9mDnob1FFQg&oe=6B09B3F6"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateSquare_1440x1440.png", "id": "2448391595528830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824609_2448391598862163_943533169723644988_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IGzTEbgeQ5kQ7kNvwEup1c2&_nc_oc=AdqV_4cIxAIOK90wkBVVQ4zeQzmUkW0qeUUl2Dcl40Plz_xoTz_dNDkXlTJ4ly9C_bE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTmO4hI4g3JKSDO_xu2QtVia0SrqZQ7AsFzVycADCJekA&oe=6B09B87E"}, {"file_name": "JobVR_LogoClaim_rgb.png", "id": "1748084809102207", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "u